===== Who is connected, and how was the connection authenticated? =====
SELECT session_user, current_user, system_user AS authenticated_as,
       (SELECT rolsuper FROM pg_roles WHERE rolname = current_user) AS is_superuser;
 session_user | current_user | authenticated_as | is_superuser 
--------------+--------------+------------------+--------------
 r2_analyst   | r2_analyst   | (null)           | f
(1 row)

===== Allowed: the aggregated view (no user data in it) =====
